\ Regression for the bare struct field accessor crash: reading a freshly
\ defined struct's field via the generated `field>>` getter under AOT
\ used to fail with `error: unknown runtime error` because the generated
\ accessor body was skipped from the AOT compilation set and never
\ rehydrated at runtime. The fix devirtualizes the single-method
\ dispatch so the body compiles directly; the typed-literal slot table
\ then handles the cross-process struct-type descriptor pointer.

point: struct{ x y } ;

3 4 make-point
x>> >string print-line

5 6 make-point
y>> >string print-line
